{"kind":"symbol","primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"tokens":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"@property"},{"kind":"text","text":" ("},{"kind":"keyword","text":"nonatomic"},{"text":") ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"c:@T@CLLocationDirection","text":"CLLocationDirection","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"direction","kind":"identifier"},{"kind":"text","text":";"}],"platforms":["iOS","iPadOS","Mac Catalyst"],"languages":["occ"]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"content":[{"level":2,"text":"Discussion","anchor":"discussion","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The value ","type":"text"},{"code":"0","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" means that the top edge of the map view corresponds to true","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"north. The value ","type":"text"},{"code":"90","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" means the top of the map is pointing due east. The","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"value ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"180"},{"text":" means the top of the map points due south, and so on.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Changing the value of this property updates the map view immediately. If you","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"want to animate the change, use the "},{"code":"-setDirection:animated:","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" method instead."}],"type":"paragraph"}],"kind":"content"}],"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNMapView\/direction","interfaceLanguage":"occ"},"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"patch":0,"minor":3},"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The heading of the map, measured in degrees clockwise from true north."}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre","doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNMapView"]]},"sections":[],"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"occ"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/maplibre\/ml